      en: ["Inaugurated in 1881 during the presidency of Justo Rufino Barrios.", "Built on the site of the former 'El Incienso' hill in the capital.", "The cemetery covers a total area of approximately 40 hectares.", "Extensively damaged by the earthquakes of 1917, 1918, and 1976.", "Home to the final resting places of many former Guatemalan presidents.", "Regarded as the country's most important funerary architecture site."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1881 por el presidente Justo Rufino Barrios.", "Construido sobre la colina 'El Incienso' en el noroeste de la ciudad.", "El cementerio abarca una superficie total de unas 40 hectáreas.", "Dañado en 1917/1918 y 1976 por fuertes terremotos.", "Alberga las tumbas de casi todos los presidentes guatemaltecos del s. XIX.", "Considerado el monumento más importante de arquitectura funeraria en Guatemala."],
