      en: ["The summit elevation is approximately 2,650 meters above sea level.", "Cerro El Baúl was designated as a National Park in May 1955.", "It is a dormant lava dome belonging to the Almolonga volcanic complex.", "A large obelisk at the top honors President Manuel Estrada Cabrera.", "It offers 360-degree views of the Quetzaltenango valley and highlands.", "The hill is frequently used by the K'iche' for sacred Mayan ceremonies."],
